newSide uses shuffle(DECK_LIST) and EXTRA_LIST slice.

Deck 34 -> HUD initial 29 after 5 deal, but state initially deck 34. We set initial HUD via render with 34. Start modal covers. Fine.

buildBoard: layout, create buttons, store map.

```js
const ZONE_LAYOUT = [];
let zoneEls = new Map();

function buildBoard(){
  const board=$('#board');
  board.innerHTML='';
  zoneEls.clear();
  // build layout once
  for (const z of ZONE_LAYOUT) {
    const b=document.createElement('button');
    b.type='button';
    b.className=`zone ${z.area} ${z.owner||'shared'}`;
    b.style.gridRow=String(z.row);
    b.style.gridColumn=String(z.col);
    b.dataset.key=zoneKey(z);
    b.addEventListener('click',()=>onZoneClick(z));
    board.appendChild(b);
    zoneEls.set(zoneKey(z), b);
  }
  const badge=document.createElement('div');
  badge.className='board-badge';
  badge.innerHTML='<b>24</b><span>ZONES</span>';
  board.appendChild(badge);
}
```

Note ZONE_LAYOUT defined at top as const array populated in function or literal. Use literal.

zoneKey: `${area}|${owner||'x'}|${index??0}`.

Zone click passes z object; z has static row/col.

